  "description": "Forget \"saving face,\" this is \"saved by face!\"\n\nRoseny has been masquerading as a boy for years at the orphanage. But when the duke chooses her to be a playmate for his son, it isn't long before her secret is revealed. Instead of being sent back, her adorable complexion results in Roseny being adopted! What will this new future hold for her?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
